                <text x="112" y="211" fill="#c0b49c" font-family="Georgia, serif" font-size="10.5" text-anchor="middle">A Guide to Prayer and Reflection</text>
                <text x="112" y="240" fill="#8f8574" font-family="Georgia, serif" font-size="9" text-anchor="middle">7 chapters · digital edition</text>
